node_modules/

# dist/ is the npm build output that Go embeds (see cmd/hupi-admin-ui/assets.go).
# A minimal placeholder dist/index.html is committed so `go build
# ./cmd/hupi-admin-ui` never fails with a go:embed error on a fresh clone
# that hasn't run `npm run build` yet. Real build output (hashed JS/CSS
# bundles, the real index.html) is produced locally/in CI by `npm run
# build` and is NOT meant to be committed back — only the placeholder is
# tracked.
dist/*
!dist/index.html
